OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding teen with no brakes
OL,4,Akilled loved grandad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding teenager with broken brakes
OL,7,Fwho killed a beloved grandfather in a
OL,8,Fcrash has been jailed for seven and a
OL,9,Fhalf years.
OL,11,FJames Waddell was travelling at 72mph
OL,12,Fin a 30mph zone when he smashed into
OL,13,FPaul Andrew Fulcher's car in Sunderland
OL,14,Fin April 2025, Newcastle Crown Court
OL,15,Fheard.
OL,17,FThe 53-year-old's family said he was a
OL,18,F"real man" who had been stolen from
OL,19,Fthem, while Waddell was an "arrogant
OL,20,Fboy" and "killer".
