OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding teen with no brakes
OL,4,Akilled loved grandad
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaddell, who was 19 at the time and is
OL,7,Fnow 21, admitted causing death by
OL,8,Fdangerous driving. Judge Tim Gittins
OL,9,Fsaid he had been driving "like a
OL,10,Fmaniac" and the teenager's "selfish,
OL,11,Farrogant and thoughtless actions" had
OL,12,Fkilled a much-loved family man.
